{"identity_key": "bilibili:1256880947544981527", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1256880947544981527", "content": "《酒鬼女神的酒诡》2nd PV\n新作游戏《酒鬼女神的酒诡》\n预计将于2026年 12月 8日 发售！\n\n\\ 俄罗斯轮盘×豪饮生存×恶魔 /\n与一位爱你爱到想杀了你的恶魔，展开一场俄罗斯轮盘赌形式的豪饮生存战，看谁先撑不住呕心吐魂。\n在喝醉酒就能打破规则的俄罗斯轮盘较量中灌醉恶魔，让她把“一切”都吐出来！\n\n快把《酒鬼女神的酒诡》加入进Steam愿望单吧！\n\n■制作人员\n制作人＆剧本作家：WHO YOU（林风肖）\n美术总监＆角色设计＆动画师：odyk\n主题曲・BGM：Aiobahn +81\n首席游戏设计师：Masatoshi Tokuok", "publisher": "AllianceArts", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1256880947544981527", "published_at": "2026-10-08T17:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3537113226152650", "uid": "3537113226152650", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_AV", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 12615, "retweets": 31, "replies": 485}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1257036532741570599", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1257036532741570599", "content": "🎉王道催眠ADV《催眠学園3年生》定档12月10日！\n✨加入愿望单！不错过首发折扣与发售通知！✨\n🔗 Steam商店：https://store.steampowered.com/app/4093040?utm_source=bili&utm_campaign=DateAnnounce\n\n🔍 本作特色\n・青春学园×王道催眠\n・催眠大师 NATORI烏賊 执笔（代表作《催眠学园》系列、《催眠学习》、《催眠术》系列）\n・知名原画师 大崎シンヤ  绘制（代表作《催眠学园》系列、《月光嘉年华》、《冻京NECRO》）\n・支持额外内容\n\n📖故事简介\n日本知名美少女游戏筆柿そふと的经典游戏！\n外貌平凡，个性内向的男主角，在一个阴错阳差之下，他顺利成为了「实习老师」。\n在他的职业生涯上会碰到什么样的奇遇呢...\n\n📌作品信息 \n・剧本： NATORI烏賊\n・原画：大崎シンヤ \n・声优：一色ヒカル（三原薰 ）、佐倉もも花（城崎琴美）、南波奈々子（加古绫香）、手塚りょうこ（氷上 雪乃）\n\n❓ 常见问题 Q&A\nQ：如何获取本游戏的额外内容？\nA：额外内容可前往白舟官网免费下载。 https://shiravune.com/zh-cn/", "publisher": "Shiravune白舟_官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1257036532741570599", "published_at": "2026-10-09T03:03:45+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T15:28:00.435009+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/a148c4a636dac8becc738dc6604777303493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c43d8b01b8ad8a17c2b103aa833b57dd3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/907ffaad7f31e940e1a1eda8ed00967f3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/92d711e2ccb31cc9146322f05824f26f3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f2030eedbcee6553d23e320cb301187e3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c1c246a94e8882e9719ae69b9654c3dd3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5c1c82bee3ed08b1006561c4f597da023493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/3a43877ede68ff50ad330499d14806443493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5fe78747a5356f1e09f8e9a2709140003493105997187935.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3493105997187935", "uid": "3493105997187935"